      "title": "Threads with shared data: what happens?",
      "images": 14,
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "Threads with shared data: what happens?",
          "kind": "heading",
          "level": 1,
          "para_break": true,
          "top": 0.121,
          "bottom": 0.204,
          "x0": 56.9,
          "cw": 17.38
        },
        {
          "text": "• What do we expect? Two threads, each",
          "kind": "text",
          "level": 0,
          "para_break": true,
          "top": 0.263,
          "bottom": 0.336,
          "x0": 79.2,
          "cw": 11.21
        },
        {
          "text": "increments counter by 10^7, so 2X10^7",
          "kind": "text",
